      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUNWAY JADE (4) has a solid record despite not breaking through for a win in 12 starts. Was below best last time when missed the frame finishing seventh (24.98) at this track. Can bounce back. BAO BUN (1) profiles well and boxed nicely for her debut. Among the main hopes. MUSTANG SABRINA (8) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (20.73) at this track in a Maiden. Lines up from box 8 for the first time. Expected to be in this for a long way. DANGEROUS DAISY (7) makes debut for the Grant Masterson kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can sneak into the frame at her first appearance.",
